# Permissions (Control Hub)

Canonical map: `docs/wayfinder/control-hub.md`. Code: `apps/edubridge/lib/auth/capabilities.ts`. Page: `/{slug}/settings/control` (`school_admin` only).

## Source of truth

- **Defaults** live in `CAPABILITIES` (role lists). Grouped by module prefix: `members.*`, `students.*`, `fees.*`, `team.*`.
- **Overrides** (slice 2) live on the school (`capability_overrides`). `can()` = override list ?? default. Member extras union in later. Key is `user_id`, never email.
- **RLS** still backstops. Do not ship a live Switch for a write the database cannot honour.
- Actions: `assertCapability`. Fees: `fees.structure` (publish) vs `fees.collect` (payments) vs `fees.view`.

## Locked vs overridable

**Locked:** `members.archive`, `members.changeRole`, `members.impersonate`; cannot grant `school_admin`; coordinator cannot target admin/coordinator. Admin column on Hub is always on.

**Overridable:** `students.view`, `students.register`, `fees.view`, `fees.collect`, `fees.structure` (default admin-only). Subject scope is `teacher_assignments`, not a Hub flag.

Honest Hub: do not enable a Switch Postgres cannot honour. Coordinator `fees.view` is live after fee SELECT RLS (slice 3a). Coordinator `fees.collect` / `fees.structure` stay locked until write RLS (slice 3b). Accountant `fees.structure` is live (RLS already allows accountant plan writes).

## Do not

```ts
// ❌ BAD
assertRole(ctx, ["school_admin", "accountant"]);

// ✅ GOOD
assertCapability(ctx, "fees.collect");
```

- No Casbin / per-email ACL / custom roles.
- No Fees fields on the SIS form.
- Control Hub is settings, not a new app. Overridable Switches persist on `schools.capability_overrides`. Locked rows stay display-only.
